1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,427
Hi, and welcome to Module 10!

2
00:00:02,427 --> 00:00:05,550
Kyntlo has a whole team
of AI helpers built in.

3
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:09,205
In this first lesson, I'll
show you what each one does,

4
00:00:09,205 --> 00:00:12,660
and exactly which of them
are included on your plan.

5
00:00:13,526 --> 00:00:16,564
All of Kyntlo's AI
tools live in one place.

6
00:00:16,564 --> 00:00:18,824
In the sidebar, click AI Agents.

7
00:00:18,824 --> 00:00:24,687
The Getting Started tab is your home base:
an overview of every AI employee in your

8
00:00:24,687 --> 00:00:25,252
account.

9
00:00:26,102 --> 00:00:28,126
This banner shows your plan.

10
00:00:28,126 --> 00:00:32,392
This demo account is on Pro,
so every AI agent is unlocked,

11
00:00:32,392 --> 00:00:34,778
with unlimited AI usage included.

12
00:00:34,778 --> 00:00:37,597
Below it, each card is one AI employee,

13
00:00:37,597 --> 00:00:41,212
with a badge for the lowest
plan that includes it.

14
00:00:42,062 --> 00:00:44,336
Conversation AI is your chatbot.

15
00:00:44,336 --> 00:00:50,234
It replies to messages on SMS, Facebook,
Instagram, WhatsApp and your website chat.

16
00:00:50,234 --> 00:00:54,214
It answers questions, and it
can even book appointments.

17
00:00:54,214 --> 00:00:56,772
It's available from the Growth plan.

18
00:00:57,623 --> 00:01:01,304
Voice AI is an AI receptionist
that answers your phone.

19
00:01:01,304 --> 00:01:02,710
That's a Pro feature.

20
00:01:02,710 --> 00:01:07,529
And the Knowledge Base is what all
your agents learn from: your website,

21
00:01:07,529 --> 00:01:09,470
your FAQs and your documents.

22
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:15,586
Content AI writes emails, social posts
and website copy, and creates images.

23
00:01:15,586 --> 00:01:18,980
Workflow AI adds smart
steps to your automations.

24
00:01:18,980 --> 00:01:23,622
And Reviews AI helps you reply to
your Google and Facebook reviews.

25
00:01:23,622 --> 00:01:25,978
We'll cover that one in Module 11.

26
00:01:26,828 --> 00:01:28,666
Now click Plans and usage.

27
00:01:28,666 --> 00:01:31,565
This table shows what each plan includes.

28
00:01:31,565 --> 00:01:34,322
Starter doesn't include the AI chatbot.

29
00:01:34,322 --> 00:01:40,260
Growth adds a basic chatbot for automated
replies and FAQs, plus the knowledge base.

30
00:01:41,111 --> 00:01:45,732
Pro unlocks the advanced chatbot,
with multi-step conversations,

31
00:01:45,732 --> 00:01:49,559
bookings and actions, plus
the Voice AI receptionist.

32
00:01:49,559 --> 00:01:55,336
Most importantly, Pro includes unlimited
AI usage, so you never pay per message.

33
00:01:56,185 --> 00:02:02,693
On plans without unlimited AI, usage is
billed at wholesale cost, with no markup.

34
00:02:02,693 --> 00:02:05,666
Conversation AI is $0.04 per message.

35
00:02:05,666 --> 00:02:08,879
And Content AI is $0.18 per 1,000 words.

36
00:02:08,879 --> 00:02:12,093
AI steps inside workflows come with Pro.

37
00:02:12,945 --> 00:02:17,546
So, if your chatbot sends 1,000
messages in a month on Growth,

38
00:02:17,546 --> 00:02:19,698
that's about $40 of AI usage.

39
00:02:19,698 --> 00:02:23,854
As you grow, Pro's unlimited
AI often works out cheaper.

40
00:02:23,854 --> 00:02:28,900
And on a Customized plan, you pick
exactly the AI features you need.

41
00:02:29,749 --> 00:02:31,828
Here's the plan for this module.

42
00:02:31,828 --> 00:02:36,052
Next, we'll set up the chatbot,
then feed it your knowledge base.

43
00:02:36,052 --> 00:02:40,666
After that, we'll build a Voice AI
receptionist, write content with AI,

44
00:02:40,666 --> 00:02:43,330
and finish with AI inside your workflows.

45
00:02:44,185 --> 00:02:45,248
Here's a pro tip.

46
00:02:45,248 --> 00:02:48,998
Build your knowledge base before
you switch on any AI agent.

47
00:02:48,998 --> 00:02:53,936
Every agent learns from it, so good
answers there mean good answers everywhere.

48
00:02:54,787 --> 00:02:56,236
That's your AI toolkit!

49
00:02:56,236 --> 00:03:00,141
In the next lesson, we'll set
up your Conversation AI chatbot,

50
00:03:00,141 --> 00:03:03,605
and teach it to answer
questions and book appointments.

51
00:03:03,605 --> 00:03:04,487
See you there.
